{"n": 512, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "512.webp", "text": "3031567\n\"\n\n33130\n7, A\n\nf\n\n31-9a\n\n3121151 REPLACING BEARING OF\nLEFT OR RIGHT WHEEL HUB\n(DRIVE FLANGE)\n— All Wheel Drive —\n\nRemove output shaft — 31 60 000.\n\nMount control arm again finger tight, so that\nthe spring strut is held in position for further\nprocedures.\n\nUnscrew brake caliper and suspend from body\non 8 piece of wire.\n\nBrake line remains connected.\n\nInstallation:\n\nTightening torque*.\n\nUnscrew brake disc.\n\nApply Special Tool 33 1 307.\nMount Special Too! 31 2 090 with the hook\nattached on tie rod arm and press off the\ndrive flange.\n\n* See Specifications of Group 34\n\ndel _\n\n30 31 569\n\nNote\n\nIf applicable, pull bearing inner race off of\ndrive flange with Special Tools 33 1 307 and\n00 7 500.\n\nLift out circlip.\n\nRemove Special Tool 31 2 090, apply Special\nTool 31 2 070, mount Special Too! 31 2 090\nagain and press out bearing.\n\nSpecial Tool 31 2 090 remains installed.\n\nUnscrew spindle of Special Too! 31 2 090 and\nscrew in Special Too} 33 4 032 flush.\n\nPull in new bearing with Special Tools\n\n33 4 034 and 33 4 038.\n\nRemove Special Tool 31 2 090.", "words": [["3031567", 0.1925, 0.7281, 0.2421, 0.7401], ["\"", 0.2026, 0.7414, 0.2067, 0.748], ["33130", 0.1494, 0.7812, 0.195, 0.7944], ["7,", 0.154, 0.7851, 0.1641, 0.8097], ["A", 0.195, 0.7971, 0.2001, 0.7997], ["f", 0.2188, 0.7619, 0.2214, 0.7679], ["31-9a", 0.4701, 0.0245, 0.5299, 0.0491], ["3121151", 0.2629, 0.0663, 0.311, 0.0776], ["REPLACING", 0.3252, 0.067, 0.388, 0.0782], ["BEARING", 0.3921, 0.067, 0.4417, 0.0782], ["OF", 0.4458, 0.0676, 0.46, 0.0789], ["LEFT", 0.3252, 0.0829, 0.3526, 0.0942], ["OR", 0.3556, 0.0829, 0.3713, 0.0942], ["RIGHT", 0.3759, 0.0829, 0.4103, 0.0942], ["WHEEL", 0.4144, 0.0836, 0.4519, 0.0942], ["HUB", 0.4564, 0.0829, 0.4787, 0.0948], ["(DRIVE", 0.3247, 0.0988, 0.3632, 0.1107], ["FLANGE)", 0.3678, 0.0995, 0.4159, 0.1107], ["—", 0.3247, 0.1207, 0.3318, 0.1227], ["All", 0